silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_04_probe_generated_authority_concrete_anchor_4#typednodeprofileclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedNodeProfileClaim is TypedNode is the third node in the R4 absorption pipeline. For the running fixture, the local witness for the GPT phrase \"Mittens is the colimit of its observable profile\" is typed by the Node-or-Arrow gate as a ProfileClaim node in the page olog O_01. Only after this typing step does the witness gain a sort declaration and become eligible for the glue step that contributes a leg into D_Mittens." .
